IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc3-participation`

-- ccc3-tests-participation.l4 -- tests of sections 83.18 to 83.231. Expected values are hand-written from the text beside each assertion.
-- Each #TRACE line carries `-- EXPECT <outcome>`, decided from the text before the run and compared by `work/trace_check.py`.

§ `Tests of sections 83.18 to 83.231`

-- A fixture for the penalty of an offence "punishable on summary conviction" that states none (section 787(1), another part): the numbers are the fixture's, not the law's.
`s 83.231 fixture summary penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `six months`), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` 5000), `no fine is stated`

-- ---- 83.18(1). Arguments: participates or contributes knowingly, for the purpose of enhancing, group a terrorist group.
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not knowingly participating or contributing
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not for the purpose of enhancing the ability of a terrorist group
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not "any activity of a terrorist group"
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an element fails whatever the group is
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`
#ASSERT `s 83.18(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `mode` EQUALS `by indictment`
-- (2): circumstances that do not matter.
#ASSERT `s 83.18(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.18(2)(a) a terrorist group actually facilitates or carries out a terrorist activity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.18(2)(b) the participation or contribution of the accused actually enhances the ability of a terrorist group to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.18(2)(c) the accused knows the specific nature of any terrorist activity that may be facilitated or carried out by a terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.18(2) another circumstance` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3): "includes" (a) to (e); (c) and (e) turn on "terrorism offence".
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(a) providing, receiving or recruiting a person to receive training` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(b) providing or offering to provide a skill or an expertise for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a terrorist group` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(d) entering or remaining in any country for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a terrorist group` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(c)(i) recruiting a person in order to facilitate or commit a terrorism offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(c)(i) recruiting a person in order to facilitate or commit a terrorism offence` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(c)(i) recruiting a person in order to facilitate or commit a terrorism offence` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(c)(ii) recruiting a person in order to facilitate or commit an act or omission outside Canada that, if committed in Canada, would be a terrorism offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(e)(i) making oneself, in response to instructions from any of the persons who constitute a terrorist group, available to facilitate or commit a terrorism offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3)(e)(ii) making oneself, in response to instructions from any of the persons who constitute a terrorist group, available to facilitate or commit an act or omission outside Canada that, if committed in Canada, would be a terrorism offence` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(3) the conduct is participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` `s 83.18(3) other conduct` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- "includes": not covered
-- (4): the factors.
#ASSERT `s 83.18(4) the court may consider the factor` `s 83.18(4)(a) the accused uses a name, word, symbol or other representation that identifies, or is associated with, the terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(4) the court may consider the factor` `s 83.18(4)(b) the accused frequently associates with any of the persons who constitute the terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(4) the court may consider the factor` `s 83.18(4)(c) the accused receives any benefit from the terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(4) the court may consider the factor` `s 83.18(4)(d) the accused repeatedly engages in activities at the instruction of any of the persons who constitute the terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.18(4) the court may consider the factor` `s 83.18(4) another factor` EQUALS NOTHING   -- "among other factors"

-- ---- 83.181, 83.191, 83.201, 83.202: leaving Canada.
#ASSERT `s 83.181 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.181 the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.181 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.181 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.181 the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`
#ASSERT `s 83.191 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.191 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.191 the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.191 the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not leaving Canada
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not for the purpose of an indictable offence
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not for the benefit of the group
#ASSERT `s 83.201 the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the act is not also a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.202 the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`

-- ---- 83.19.
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not knowingly
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.19(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`   -- "fourteen years"
-- (2): the three circumstances do not matter: the same answer for every combination.
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 83.19(2) a terrorist activity is facilitated` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- no facilitating conduct: the subsection is silent

-- ---- 83.2, 83.21, 83.22.
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not an indictable offence
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with the group
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.2 the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.21(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
#ASSERT `s 83.21(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.21(2)(a) the activity that the accused instructs to be carried out is actually carried out` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.21(2)(g) the accused knows the specific nature of any terrorist activity that may be facilitated or carried out by a terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the last of (a) to (g)
#ASSERT `s 83.21(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.21(2)(d) the person whom the accused instructs knows that it is to be carried out for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a terrorist group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.21(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.21(2) another circumstance` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.22(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.22(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.22(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.22(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.22(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
#ASSERT `s 83.22(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.22(2)(a) the terrorist activity is actually carried out` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.22(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.22(2)(d) the person whom the accused instructs to carry out the terrorist activity knows that it is a terrorist activity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.22(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` `s 83.22(2) another circumstance` EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- 83.221.
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- identifying a specific terrorism offence: not "without identifying"
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- does not counsel
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the offence counselled is not a terrorism offence
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE NOTHING FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.221(1) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `five years`
#ASSERT `s 83.221(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.221(2) the circumstance does not prevent an offence under subsection (1)` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- whether or not the counselled person commits a terrorism offence

-- ---- 83.222(8): terrorist propaganda, court, judge.
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) a writing` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) a sign` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) a visible representation` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) an audio recording` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) a writing` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a writing that does not counsel a terrorism offence
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) a writing` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) terrorist propaganda` `s 83.222(8) something that is none of those` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means"
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) court` `the court` `the court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) court` `a judge` `the court` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) judge` `a judge` `a judge` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(8) judge` `the court` `a judge` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- ---- 83.222(1) to (7).
#ASSERT `s 83.222(1) the judge may issue a warrant of seizure` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(1) the judge may issue a warrant of seizure` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(1) the judge may issue a warrant of seizure` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- copies not kept in premises within the court's jurisdiction
-- The warrant is issued on 1 March 2026: the seventh day after is 8 March 2026.
#ASSERT `s 83.222(2) the last day for issuing the summons` (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS Date 8 3 2026
#ASSERT `s 83.222(2) the summons is issued in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 8 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the seventh day
#ASSERT `s 83.222(2) the summons is issued in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the eighth day
#ASSERT `s 83.222(2) the summons is issued in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the same day
#ASSERT `s 83.222(2) the summons is issued in time` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- before the warrant: not "after the day on which the warrant is issued"
#TRACE `s 83.222(2) the duty to issue the summons` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a judge` DOES `s 83.222(2) issues a summons to the premises’ occupier requiring the occupier to appear before the court and to show cause why the matter seized should not be forfeited to Her Majesty` AT 7   -- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 83.222(2) the duty to issue the summons` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a judge` DOES `s 83.222(2) issues a summons to the premises’ occupier requiring the occupier to appear before the court and to show cause why the matter seized should not be forfeited to Her Majesty` AT 8   -- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 83.222(2) the duty to issue the summons` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 8)   -- EXPECT BREACH
#ASSERT `s 83.222(3) the person may appear and be represented before the court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(3) the person may appear and be represented before the court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(3) the person may appear and be represented before the court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(4) the court may order the matter forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(4) the court may order the matter forfeited to Her Majesty` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(5) the court may order the matter restored` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(5) the court may order the matter restored` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- before the time for final appeal has expired
#ASSERT `s 83.222(5) the court may order the matter restored` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the court is satisfied that it is terrorist propaganda
#ASSERT `s 83.222(6) the person may appeal from the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.222(6) the person may appeal from the order` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- did not appear before the court
#ASSERT `s 83.222(6) the person may appeal from the order` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not an order under (4) or (5)
#ASSERT `s 83.222(6) the person may appeal from the order` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.222(7) the proceeding is barred from being instituted` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- no consent
#ASSERT `s 83.222(7) the proceeding is barred from being instituted` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- consent given: the bar says nothing

-- ---- 83.223.
#ASSERT `s 83.223(1) the judge may order the computer system’s custodian` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(1) the judge may order the computer system’s custodian` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(1) the judge may order the computer system’s custodian` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(1) the judge may order the computer system’s custodian` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not within the court's jurisdiction
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge must cause notice to be given to the person who posted the material` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge must cause notice to be given to the person who posted the material` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not within a reasonable time
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge must cause notice to be given to the person who posted the material` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- information (1)(c) not yet received
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge may order the custodian to post the text of the notice` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge may order the custodian to post the text of the notice` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(2) the judge may order the custodian to post the text of the notice` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(3) the person who posted the material may appear and be represented before the court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(3) the person who posted the material may appear and be represented before the court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(4) the court may proceed in the absence of the person` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(4) the court may proceed in the absence of the person` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(5) the court may order the custodian to delete the material` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(5) the court may order the custodian to delete the material` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(6) the court may order the destruction of the electronic copy` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(6) the court may order the destruction of the electronic copy` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "When" the court makes the order for deletion
#ASSERT `s 83.223(7) the court must order the copy returned` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(7) the court must order the copy returned` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(8) the person may appeal from the order` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(8) the person may appeal from the order` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(8) the person may appeal from the order` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(9) the proceeding is barred from being instituted` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(9) the proceeding is barred from being instituted` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.223(10) the order does not yet take effect` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- before the time for final appeal has expired
#ASSERT `s 83.223(10) the order does not yet take effect` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- after it
#ASSERT `s 83.223(10) the order does not yet take effect` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an order of another kind
#ASSERT `s 83.223(11) computer data` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(11) computer data` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.223(11) computer system` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- 83.23.
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not knowingly harbouring or concealing
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- does not know the other person carried out a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not for the purpose of enabling
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the activity is not a terrorism offence
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
-- (a) 14 years if that offence is punishable by imprisonment for life; (b) 10 years if liable to any other punishment.
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the punishment of the offence` (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`) EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the punishment of the offence` (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`) EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
#ASSERT `s 83.23(1) the punishment of the offence` (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`) EQUALS Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`   -- liable to a term, not life: limb (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- does not know the other person is likely to carry out a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.23(2) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`

-- ---- 83.231(1): lawful excuse, intent to cause fear, (a) conveys information without believing it, or (b) commits an act without believing.
GIVEN e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A BOOLEAN, a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 83.231(1) facts`
`s 83.231(1) test facts` MEANS `s 83.231(1) facts` OF e, f, c, t, a, b
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (a), but believing the information to be true
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (b), but believing the activity is occurring
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- with lawful excuse
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without the intent
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.231(1) the person commits the offence` (`s 83.231(1) test facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a) fails (believes it) but (b) holds
#ASSERT `s 83.231(2) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `s 83.231(2) the punishments of the offence` `s 83.231 fixture summary penalty` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`), `s 83.231 fixture summary penalty`
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the punishments of the offence` `s 83.231 fixture summary penalty` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`), `s 83.231 fixture summary penalty`
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no harm caused
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the harm is not "bodily harm" as section 2 defines it
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` (JUST TRUE) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` (JUST FALSE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- no offence under (1)
#ASSERT `s 83.231(3) the person commits the offence causing bodily harm` NOTHING TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the person commits the offence causing death` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the person commits the offence causing death` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the person commits the offence causing death` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the person commits the offence causing death` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 83.231(4) the punishment of the offence`'s `maximum imprisonment` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
